{
  "title": "Ferry — Logs",
  "uid": "ferry-logs",
  "tags": ["llm-ferry", "logs"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "Model",
        "description": "Model NAMED by the log line (the `model` field) — not necessarily one that served a request: litellm names models at startup too. Measured 2026-08-29 over 13182 real records, every model-naming line was a startup mention and none of the 13076 request lines named a model, so pair this with `attribution` rather than reading it as routing truth. Multi-select; All matches every log line via LogsQL `in(*)`.",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "gemini-3.8-flash,gpt-6-astra,gpt-5.6-sol,gpt-5.6-luna,Qwen3.8-27B-nvfp4,NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-NVFP4",
        "options": [
          { "selected": false, "text": "gemini-3.8-flash", "value": "gemini-3.8-flash" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "gpt-6-astra", "value": "gpt-6-astra" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "gpt-5.6-sol", "value": "gpt-5.6-sol" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "gpt-5.6-luna", "value": "gpt-5.6-luna" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "Qwen3.8-27B-nvfp4", "value": "Qwen3.8-27B-nvfp4" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-NVFP4", "value": "NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Nano-30B-A3B-NVFP4" }
        ],
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "*",
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      },
      {
        "name": "level",
        "label": "Level",
        "description": "Log level shipped by ferry-log-shipper (`level` field). Multi-select; All matches every log line via LogsQL `in(*)`.",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "info,warn,error",
        "options": [
          { "selected": false, "text": "info", "value": "info" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "warn", "value": "warn" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "error", "value": "error" }
        ],
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "*",
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      },
      {
        "name": "attribution",
        "label": "Attribution",
        "description": "Did this line describe a SERVED request, or merely mention a model? `request` = an access line, a fallback, a cooldown, a rate-limit or another mid-call event. `mention` = startup registration, cost-map warnings, catalogue dumps. Defaults to All; pick `request` to see routing rather than boot noise. Records shipped before this field existed carry no value and appear only under All — verified 2026-08-29: `in(*)` matched all 120268 existing records, `in(request)` matched 0.",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "request,mention",
        "options": [
          { "selected": false, "text": "request", "value": "request" },
          { "selected": false, "text": "mention", "value": "mention" }
        ],
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": ["All"], "value": ["$__all"] },
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "*",
        "hide": 0,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "links": [],
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Ferry — Logs\nPer-model proxy logs for the **llm-ferry** LAN LLM relay — filter the live tail by backend `model` and `level`, and watch errors/fallbacks land in real time. Logs from VictoriaLogs via `ferry-log-shipper`; adjust LogsQL filters as needed.\n\nFields: `_msg` `_time` `source` `level` `status` `model` `requested_model` `attribution` `client_ip`. `attribution` separates a line that SERVED a request from one that merely NAMES a model — the proxy log carries no request→model mapping at all, so `model` alone is not routing truth. Query language: **LogsQL**. Datasource: `victoriametrics-logs-datasource` (uid `ferry-vlogs`, VictoriaLogs :9428)."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Log volume by level",
      "description": "LogsQL stats over the panel range: `source:proxy | stats by (level) count() as logs`. Uses the plugin's `Range` query type (/select/logsql/stats_query_range).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 18, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "statsRange",
          "expr": "source:proxy | stats by (level) count() as logs",
          "legendFormat": "{{level}}",
          "step": "$__interval"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 70,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }
          },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "#2a78d6", "value": null }]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*error.*" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#d03b3b" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*warn.*" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#fab219" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*info.*" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#2a78d6" } }]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Errors in window",
      "description": "LogsQL instant stats: `level:error | stats count() as errors`. Uses the plugin's `Instant` query type (/select/logsql/stats_query).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 3 },
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "stats",
          "expr": "level:error | stats count() as errors"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "#0ca30c", "value": null },
              { "color": "#fab219", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "#d03b3b", "value": 10 }
            ]
          },
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "noValue": "0"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Proxy logs — model: $model · level: $level · $attribution",
      "description": "Live tail of the litellm proxy log, filtered by the Model and Level variables. LogsQL: `source:proxy AND model:in($model) AND level:in($level)` — the plugin expands a multi-value variable to `in(\"a\",\"b\")` and the All option to `in(*)`, which matches every log line.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 9 },
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "source:proxy AND model:in($model) AND level:in($level) AND attribution:in($attribution)",
          "direction": "desc",
          "maxLines": 1000
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Errors & fallbacks",
      "description": "Unfiltered by the Model/Level variables on purpose — every error line plus any fallback hop or Gemini RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED quota trip, from any source. LogsQL: `level:error OR _msg:~\"[Ff]allback\" OR _msg:~\"RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\"`.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "level:error OR _msg:~\"[Ff]allback\" OR _msg:~\"RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED\"",
          "direction": "desc",
          "maxLines": 500
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Gemini 429 rate",
      "description": "Gemini quota-exhaustion 429s over time, counted from VictoriaLogs (`_msg:~\"429 Too Many Requests\"`) alongside fallback hops. An at-a-glance BURST watch on the logs dashboard: brief blips are normal (failover absorbs them), a sustained spike means the pool's aggregate rate limit is being exceeded. For per-KEY attribution (which key is 429ing), see the 'Gemini 429s by key' panel on the Backends dashboard, which uses litellm_proxy_failed_requests_metric_total grouped by model_id.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
          "refId": "A",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "statsRange",
          "expr": "source:proxy AND _msg:~\"429 Too Many Requests\" | stats count() as \"429s\"",
          "legendFormat": "Gemini 429s",
          "step": "$__interval"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource", "uid": "ferry-vlogs" },
          "refId": "B",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "queryType": "statsRange",
          "expr": "source:proxy AND _msg:~\"[Ff]allback\" | stats count() as \"fallbacks\"",
          "legendFormat": "fallbacks fired",
          "step": "$__interval"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["sum", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 60, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" } },
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Gemini 429s" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] },
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "fallbacks fired" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } } ] }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
